# English language

All project documents, plans, READMEs, Storybook copy, JSDoc, inline comments, commit messages, and pull request text MUST be written in English.

Do not write Russian or any other non-English prose into repository files, comments, or git metadata.

Chat with the user may follow the user's language preference. Committed work is English only.
